{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12189","headline":"秋夜梁七兵曹同宿二首 一 · 钱起","name":"秋夜梁七兵曹同宿二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一笑不可得，同心相见稀。\n摘菱频贳酒，待月未扃扉。\n星影低惊鹊，虫声傍旅衣。\n卑栖岁已晚，共羡鴈南飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}